{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Lift up</b> Three times in the Masorah: הרם את מטך · כשופר הרם קולך · ויאמר הרם לך — teaches that he raised and stirred them with sounds. And the other, concerning Elisha when the iron floated: just as here a miracle was performed through water, so too there a miracle was performed through water." "<b>And split it</b> — in the merit of ויבקע עצי עולה and in the merit of בקע לגלגלת. He reads it בקע with a vav — by this name the waters were split."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "The phrase הממם וערבב אותם בקולות is difficult; translated hyper-literally. Possibly corrupt."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:54.082324701Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}